To overwrite the eclipse repository URL and use a mirror, add the following to your .m2/settings.xml

       <mirror>        
                <id>override</id>
                <mirrorOf>eclipse-repo</mirrorOf>
                <url>https://my-mirror.eclipse.org/releases/2018-12</url>
                <layout>p2</layout>
                <mirrorOfLayouts>p2</mirrorOfLayouts>
        </mirror>